    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PII TTL — recent_messages scrub (FIX-1, 2026-08-27)\n\n**What:** every day at 04:00 this second branch clears `conversations.recent_messages` on rows whose\n`last_updated` is older than **30 days**.\n\n**Why the row is KEPT, not deleted:** deleting the row would (a) silently release a `stage='handoff'`\nlock — a handed-off customer would start getting bot replies again with nobody deciding that — and\n(b) drop `cancel_target_id`/`confirm_turn`. Row deletion is a separate decision (UX-ARCHITECTURE §9 K2).\n\n**Honest scope:** this expires message CONTENT. `sender_key` (a phone number on whatsapp) survives for\nthe row's lifetime. Do NOT describe this as \"PII TTL solved\".",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "purge_sticky_pii",
      "name": "Sticky — PII scrub",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
